+### `constantCase`
+
+Splits string and joins by CONSTANT_CASE (a.k.a. SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE) convention:
+
+```ts
+constantCase("fooBar");
+// FOO_BAR
+```
+
 ### `trainCase(str, opts?: { normalize })`
 
 Split string and joins by Train-Case (a.k.a. HTTP-Header-Case) convention:
